cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this game or tutorial, please cite it as below."
title: "Jev Ants: when ants ask a decision model"
abstract: >-
  An ant colony in the browser where every ant asks a decision model
  (TypeSafe Jev, or a local model through Ollama) what to do next, and the
  player, as the queen, steers the colony with one sentence: a Streamlit
  game, and a tutorial in German and English that builds it in eight steps,
  with options made at runtime, a confidence threshold and a dice as the
  yardstick.
type: software
authors:
